id: pm-7ouxrr
title: Exclude the dated Codex plugin research plan from the npm tarball to restore publication headroom
description: "Next pm-998juj tranche, required before the credential-redaction bundle (pm-gh1699, pm-nhauur, pm-5htunt) can publish. On branch fix/credential-shape-coverage, a clean 'rm -rf dist && pnpm build' followed by scripts/release/package-artifact-gate.mjs fails with unpacked_size:20018916>20000000. The base profile was already within a few KB of the ceiling on main. docs/CHATGPT_CODEX_PLUGIN_IMPLEMENTATION.md (38,076 B) is a dated research and implementation plan (research date 2026-07-11) that says it records no completed remediation. It is the same repository-only class as docs/ECOSYSTEM_PLANNING_REVIEW.md, which pm-1ke3mz excluded. Nothing in src, scripts, tests, plugins or packages reads it, and it is not a pm guide topic. Only docs/CODEX_PLUGIN.md and docs/README.md (twice) link it relatively. Duplicate check: pm-998juj children and the pm-1ke3mz approach; the memory-recorded next candidate was this file."
