resolution: package.json files excludes docs/CHATGPT_CODEX_PLUGIN_IMPLEMENTATION.md. docs-reachability-exceptions.json records the reason. docs/CODEX_PLUGIN.md and both docs/README.md links use the canonical GitHub URL with the repository-only exclusion stated.
expected_result: A clean build passes the base and simulated Sentry-injected package artifact gates.
actual_result: "Base: 19,981,167 / 20,000,000 B, down from 20,018,916. Sentry-injected simulation: 20,261,123 / 20,300,288 B. docs-skills-gate passes."
